expect Rapid · Rated
clean
shot home
maybe-tap-id home-previous
tap How to play
expect Chess on Lichess
expect Outlined squares show the last move.
# How to play turns a page at the larger text sizes; at the default size it
# is one page and draws no pager.
maybe-tap-id help-next
expect Choose rated or casual games in Account/Games.
wait 250
clean
shot lichess-help
tap Play
expect Computer
tap Puzzles
wait-for Download 32 puzzles
expect-missing Resume puzzle
tap Back
expect Computer
maybe-tap-id home-next
tap 10+0
wait-for Connect Lichess
expect Connect a Lichess account to play people. Computer and Puzzles work without one.
expect-missing Challenge player
clean
shot time-tile-without-account
tap Connect Lichess
wait-for Account key
expect lichess.org/account/oauth/token
expect Use phone
clean
shot connect-prompt
tap Use phone
wait-for Opens the Lichess token page
clean
shot connect-phone
tap Back
wait-for Account key
tap Back
wait-for Connect Lichess
tap-id seek-casual
tap Back
wait-for Rapid · Casual
expect-missing Rapid · Rated
clean
shot home-casual
maybe-tap-id home-previous
tap-id play-computer
wait-for Start game
expect No clock
expect Random
tap-id computer-side-black
tap-id start-computer
wait-for Kobo
expect Black · Your move · Casual · Nc3
expect-missing 10:00
clean
shot computer-black-untimed
tap-id square-e7
expect e7 →
tap-id square-e5
wait-for Black · Your move · Casual · Nf3
expect-missing e7 →
expect-missing Move sent
clean
